      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Outlining based on skinned meshes for pickups in worlds is planned to be temporarily rolled back for the live release of 2026.2.3 while we investigate this issue.\n\nWe are currently aiming to expose a renderer array for VRCPickup in the SDK to allow world creators to manually define which meshes should be used for the outline if they want to. If none are defined, the system will try to determine the outline automatically instead.",
