  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "In a recent Open Beta it was announced that the VRC highlight now highlights Skinned mesh renderers.\n\nThis functionality should be opt-in through the Pickup Component or auto assigned based on the renderer it is added to. Currently this changes how old pickups show and now add an overlay over invisible parts which may go against how the creator intended.\n\nIf the option is to be set as the default, it would be nice to include an array within the pickup component where we can 'hide' renderers within the pickup child to be ignored by the hover highlight.",
